      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### Code Coverage & Benchmarks\nFor details see: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36272.\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\n| Type | Reviewers |\n| ---- | --------- |\n| Concept ACK | [hebasto](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36272#pullrequestreview-5223532415) |\n\nIf your review is incorrectly listed, please copy-paste <code>&lt;!--meta-tag:bot-skip--&gt;</code> into the comment that the bot should ignore.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#36233](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36233) (guix: Update time-machine to `60f6956aeffa7f30285745bd0ea615e9acfc74f8` by hebasto)\n* [#36193](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36193) (guix: pass `--disable-wchar_t` to (non-GUI) libstdc++ by fanquake)\n* [#35855](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35855) (guix: update time-machine by fanquake)\n* [#25573](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/25573) (guix: produce a `-static-pie` bitcoind by fanquake)\n\nIf you consider this pull request important, please also help to review the conflicting pull requests. Ideally, start with the one that should be merged first.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->",
